# Rust build output
/target

# Local, per-user Claude Code settings (shared settings.json would be committed)
.claude/settings.local.json

# Defensive: provider key-files live in $HOME, never in the repo — but never
# let one slip in if it's ever dropped here.
*-key.txt
*-key
*.key
.anthropic-key.txt
.deepseek-key
.gemini-api-key

# signoff.md — ephemeral, personal cross-session handoff; never commit.
# Durable notes belong in the pull request and CHANGELOG.md instead.
signoff.md

# Node artifacts from tooling run inside the repo (codex CLI and friends). kaibo has
# no JS build; these are never ours. Listed because @openai/codex vendors a ~300MB
# binary, which GitHub's 100MB pre-receive hook rejects — a `git add -A` that swept it
# in cost a reset and recommit (2026-07-25). Staging by name is the real fix; this is
# the belt.
node_modules/
package.json
package-lock.json
